    "text": "This is made by and between Shell Exploration & Production Company and its affiliates and successors (“Company”) and Nicole Ryder (“You,” “you,” “your,” or “Fy and your heirs and successors. In consideration of the mutual promises in this : and other good and valuable consideration, the receipt and sufficiency of which is acknowledged, you and the Company agree as follows:"
