    "name": "2(a). Prorated Payment",
    "text": "2. Terms of Payment, Pursuant to the provisions of the Agreement: a. In the event that ducing the Reteation Period (f} your employment with the Company tenninates due to a Company fuitiated severance or your death ot Ci) you are transferred out of the position you held at the start of the Reteation Period for a different position with the Company for any reason, the Payment will be prorated bassd on the percentage of the Retention Period that you were employed by the Company or held such initial position, as applicable, This adjusted amount will be payable to you (or your estate) within 15 days of such termination or change in position and no additional amount shall be payable to you under this Agreenient."
  },
  {
    "id": "c007",
    "name": "2(b). Resignation or Retirement",
    "text": "b. Should your employment with the Company terminate during the Retention Period due ta your resignation or retirement (other than retirement in connection with a Company initiated severance), any amount(s) scheduled to be paid shall be forfeited and you waive all rights to afl or part of the Payment."
  },
  {
