    "name": "2(c). Forfeiture for Misconduct",
    "text": "c. Notwithstanding any provision hereof to the contrary, any 1 amount of the Payment under this Agreement shall be forfeited if during the Retention Period the Company concludes that (i) you failed to meet performance expectations in your assignments and responsibilities, (ii) you committed fraud or dishonesty with respect to the Company, (iii) you willfully damaged the assets of, or engaged in misconduct which in any material respect was injurious to the Company, (iv) you wrongfully disclosed or used any proprietary or confidential information which is related to the business, properties or affuirs of the Company and the release or use of which is detrimental in any material respect to its competitive position or goodwill, (v) you engaged in any activity which in any material respect reasonably constitutes a conflict with the interests of the Company, or (vi) you violated the Company Code of Conduct in any respect."
  },
