    "id": "c009",
    "name": "2(d). Temporary Leave of Absence",
    "text": "d. In the event that you are granted a temporary leave of absence (including military or sick leave, ct to enter governmental employment) during the Retention Period, your employment shalt be deemed to continue unchanged for purposes of the Agreement while you are on that leave; provided that in the case of certain leaves of absences, any unpaid amount of the Payment may be paid to you earlier than scheduled so that such amount does not constitute nonqualified deferred compensation under Section 409A of the Internal Revenue Code,"
