  {
    "id": "c011",
    "name": "4. No Employment Rights",
    "text": "No Employment Rights. Nothing in this Agreement shall confer upon you any right to be retained as a director, officer or employee of the Company. Notwithstanding any provision of this Agreement, the Company may in its sole discretion terminate your employment before, during, or subsequent to, the termination of this Agreement, with or without cause and with or without notice,"
