    "id": "c012",
    "name": "5. Notices",
    "text": "5. Notices, Any notice relating to the Agreement shall be in waiting or in such form as may be acceptable to the Company. All notices to the Company shall be addressed to Michelle Reyes, HR Account Manager — Commercial/NVBD, Shell Exploration & Production Company. All notices sent to you shall be sent to you at 218 Jaimes Coust, Houston, Texas, 77094. You may designate a new address by notice to that effect. Each notice shall be deemed to have been offectively given when mailed, or delivered in person, to the proper address,"
