    "name": "10. Unfunded",
    "text": "10. Unfunded, This Agreement shall be unfunded, and the Company shall not be required to segregate any assets with respect to Payment benefits under the Agreement, Any liability of the Company to any person with respect to a benefit under this shall be based solely upon any contractual obligations that may be ereated hereunder; no such obligations of the Company shall be deemed to be secured by any pledge or other encumbrance on any property of the Company, or funded or secured in any way. Nothing contained in this Agreement shall be deemed to create a trust of any kind or create any fiduciary relationship."
  },
