    "name": "14. Confidentiality",
    "text": "14. Confidentiality. You ageee and promise that you will hold the existence and tho contents of this Agreament in strict confidence and pot disctose in any manner or. otherwise give to others any information conceming this Agreement, except that: you may disclose this Agtocment and the Payiient fo your spouse, accountant, (ax advisor, or lawyer or as requited by law. Notwithstanding any other provision in this Agreement, you understand and agree that in the évent you disclose or threaten to disclose any such information except ag stated herein, you'will not receive the. Payidnt."
